# Generated code snippets — do not edit

`my_site_package/` is a copy of the
[site_package](https://github.com/TYPO3-Documentation/site_package) repository
(branch `main`). The tutorial includes files from it so that the code on the
page is the code of the real site package the reader builds, rather than a
second copy that drifts away from it.

**Do not fix anything inside `my_site_package/` here.** `make codesnippets`
runs `Build/DownloadSitePackage/generate_sitepackage.sh`, which deletes the
whole directory and copies it again from that repository; a scheduled workflow
does the same on the first of every month and opens a pull request with the
result. A change made here is gone at that point, without a conflict and
without a warning.

Fix it in [site_package](https://github.com/TYPO3-Documentation/site_package)
instead. The next regeneration carries it over.

The `_codesnippets/` directories inside the chapters (`ContentMapping/`,
`FluidTemplates/`) are the opposite: hand-written fragments and diffs with no
upstream counterpart. Those are edited here as normal.
